Begin Add a New Admin Tab
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Open "System" charttab
	Open "Menu Editor" charttab subtab
	Click the "Add Menu Item" link
	Select "admin" from the "Module" dropdown
	Type "MenuEditorTest" into the "Name" field
	Type "?f=admin&t=menueditor&tabselect=MenuEditorTest" into the "URL" field
	Type "MenuEditorTest Description" into the "Description" field
	Select "System" from the "Parent Tab" dropdown
	Select "Last" from the "insert_op" dropdown
	Click the "show_in_wc" checkbox
	Click the 3rd "Add" button

Begin Confirm that it worked
	CLick the "Admin" charttab
	Verify exists "MenuEditorTest Description" text
	Open "System" charttab
	Open "MenuEditorTest" charttab subtab
	Verify exists "Tabs" listview name

